From: obig20 <obig20@example.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 18:28:24 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 03/18] Wire settings and best-run records into the game

Pause screen gets volume, camera speed and invert-Y controls; the win screen
shows best time / fewest falls and flags a new best. Synth gets setVolume,
the camera gets sensitivity/invertY and a look() method.

Co-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
